<article class="prose wrap">
  {% include "partials/breadcrumbs.njk" %}
  <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
  <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
  <p>{{ site.disclosure }} Advertising is labeled. A commission does not change a local listing, and it is not a reason we include or exclude a lot.</p>

  <h2>Programs we may join</h2>
  <p>Airport pages and the <a href="/guides/airport-parking-full-what-to-do-and-where-to-park-instead/">sold-out parking guide</a> include clearly marked links for Airport Parking Reservations.</p>
  <ul>
    {% for key, program in site.affiliates %}
    <li>
      <strong>{{ program.name }}</strong>
      {% if program | affiliateIsTracked %}
      — If you click through the marked link and complete a qualifying booking, OverflowParking may receive a commission.
      {% else %}
      — The button currently goes to that company’s <a href="{{ program.publicUrl }}" rel="noopener">public website</a>. It is a placeholder until an affiliate link is approved through <a href="{{ program.programUrl }}" rel="noopener">the official program page</a>. We will not present a placeholder as a tracked affiliate URL.
      {% endif %}
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>

  <h2>Official airport and lot links are not affiliate links</h2>
  <p>Links to official airport reservation pages and to an individual operator’s own booking page are ordinary deep links to those public sites. We will not treat them as affiliate offers unless a program issues a tracked URL and we disclose it.</p>

  <h2>Listings are not paid placements</h2>
  <p>The directory itself is researched from public sources. We do not charge a fee to be included in the first version of this site, and we do not accept payment to invent or inflate hours, shuttle facts, or rates. If that policy changes, we will say so here and on the affected page.</p>

  <p>Questions: <a href="mailto:{{ site.emailContact }}">{{ site.emailContact }}</a>.</p>
</article>
